        ('1-10006', 'BCA # 5325107836', 'ASSET', 'CURRENT ASSET', 'CASH & CASH EQUIVALENTS', 'Cash held in bank accounts, including foreign-currency bank balances.', 'Assets > Current assets > Cash and cash equivalents', 'std_asset_current_cash_bank', 'Cash and cash equivalents', 'https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/ifrs-taxonomy/', 'DEBIT'),
